{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20508","headline":"早朝寄白舍人严郎中 · 张籍","name":"早朝寄白舍人严郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鼓声初动未闻鸡，羸马街中踏冻泥。\n烛暗有时冲石柱，雪深无处认沙堤。\n常参班里人犹少，待漏房前月欲西。\n凤阙星郎离去远，合门开日入还齐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20508.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20508","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}